  "limits": [
    "Logical selected aggregate ownership only. Primitive virtual paths, strict profiles and retained specs refuse.",
    "All aggregate formals are borrowed, including across known calls and fold-body checks. Known identities therefore refuse even when some actual caller passes fresh storage.",
    "Ordinary folds require BOTH original initializer and body-return field private. Predicate/unknown producers refuse.",
    "Full nested set/put may conservatively refuse when a replacement removes the only borrowed child; selected child proofs can still qualify.",
    "No IO affinity, effect removal, read motion, parameter narrowing, helper substitution or trap/source-frame permission is granted.",
    "The actual ap_read specialization/private emission plan is not implemented. No transformed artifact, timing, memory, physical-copy, bootstrap floor or production adoption claim. Earlier measured losses remain binding."
  ],
  "decision": "Freeze the ownership law and independent controls. Next private-variant work must retain opaque M, all affine IO, original capture/effect positions and public roots; quiet combined costs remain a separate gate."
